Package: modena
Type: Package
Title: R Interface to the MoDeNa Surrogate Model Framework
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("MoDeNa", "Consortium", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "modena@example.com")
Description: R wrapper for the MoDeNa C library (libmodena). Allows R
    simulation codes to load and evaluate MoDeNa surrogate models that were
    trained via the Python/MongoDB back-end.  Provides the 'Modena' reference
    class with the same interface as the Julia and MATLAB wrappers.
License: LGPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
SystemRequirements: libmodena (MoDeNa C library), Python >= 3.10, MongoDB
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
